* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary

# The loop's records and the desk ledgers the tools write are append-only event logs: two hands
# appending at EOF are BOTH right, so union keeps both rows (the fund repo's rule, carried here with
# app/loop/records on 2026-09-25). Every reader of a .jsonl here is order-insensitive.
*.jsonl merge=union
